# shapes (the definition, the options, the analysis document, the result,
# the result summary, the validation issues, the finite element settings
# and the reliability options) are generated from the engine's JSON schemas
# (packages/engine/schema) by packages/engine-rs/tools/schema.ts, between
# the GENERATED markers; CI checks they are fresh. The rest is written by
# hand. Keys are camelCase, as in the engine's JSON.

